## Title: Better Character Overview
## Author: Copper
## Version: 1.12.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## AddOnVersion: 11200
## Description: Adds a native All Inventories page to the PS5 gamepad Inventory with compact item-location details, cross-character currencies, furnishing preview, furnishings grouped by furniture category and subcategory (/bcosub) and cataloged from bank, housing storage, and owned houses, guild store listings per guild, and All/Banked/Characters/Storage/Listed source filters, excluding the Craft Bag. Every item tooltip also counts copies held by other characters, placed in owned houses, or listed in guild stores.
